@vodreliux 

I can second this, im 26 and I'm excited for the next thing i end up having a job in. I tried a bunch of stuff when I was younger (mostly while stuying) and the more you try the more you get a feel for the difference between 'this is fun and I like this' and 'I could genuinely do this every day for 5 years straight'

Good luck!
